# api/jobs/refresh.ts was ignored here to stay under the Vercel Hobby cap of 12
# Serverless Functions per deployment. That file was deleted in c23d6f8, which left
# this rule as a no-op, and the cap was then silently crossed by later feature
# work — every deploy has failed since 2026-09-17 as a result. The mitigation is
# gone on purpose: consolidating routes through vercel.json rewrites (the
# api/sources.ts pattern) is the real fix, and ignoring a live route would hide
# the symptom by breaking that route at runtime.
#
# Run `bun run check:vercel-functions` to see where the count actually stands.
